#. help text (2/3)
#: src/lib/registration/ui/addon_selection_base_dialog.rb:287
msgid ""
"<p>Please note, that some extensions or modules might need specific "
"registration code.</p>"
msgstr ""
"<p>ກະລຸນາສັງເກດວ່າ ສ່ວນເສີມ ຫຼື ໂມດູນບາງອັນອາດຈະຕ້ອງໃຊ້ລະຫັດການລົງທະບຽນສະເພາະ.</p>"

#. help text (3/3)
#: src/lib/registration/ui/addon_selection_base_dialog.rb:290
msgid ""
"<p>If you want to remove any extension or module you need to log into the "
"SUSE Customer Center and remove them manually there.</p>"
msgstr ""
"<p>ຖ້າທ່ານຕ້ອງການລຶບສ່ວນເສີມ ຫຼື ໂມດູນໃດໜຶ່ງອອກ ທ່ານຕ້ອງລົງຊື່ເຂົ້າໃຊ້ສູນລູກຄ້າ SUSE ແລ້ວລຶບພວກມັນອອກດ້"
"ວຍຕົນເອງຢູ່ທີ່ນັ້ນ.</p>"

#: src/lib/registration/ui/addon_selection_base_dialog.rb:295
msgid ""
"<p>The extensions and modules can have several states depending how they "
