msgstr ""
"<p>ສ່ວນເສີມ ແລະ ໂມດູນສາມາດມີໄດ້ຫຼາຍສະຖານະ ຂຶ້ນກັບວ່າພວກມັນຖືກເລືອກແນວໃດ.</p>"

#. TRANSLATORS: help text for checked check box
#: src/lib/registration/ui/addon_selection_base_dialog.rb:299
msgid ""
"The extension or module is selected to install by user or is pre-selected as "
